WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.210
More music in your school.

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.630
More confidence in your pupils.

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:07.440
And less for your team to organise.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.364
Meet My Music Lessons.

00:00:10.247 --> 00:00:12.607
It starts with a conversation.

00:00:12.647 --> 00:00:14.607
Tell us about your school.

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:19.247
Together, we agree the instruments, rooms
and teaching times.

00:00:19.287 --> 00:00:23.319
Then our team manages the setup and
day-to-day running.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:29.050
Piano, guitar, ukulele, drums and singing.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.400
We agree what works for your school,

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:34.969
and provide the lesson instruments free as
part of the service.

00:00:35.847 --> 00:00:38.567
At the heart of it all: encouraging teachers

00:00:38.607 --> 00:00:41.727
who help pupils find their sound.

00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:45.817
We manage teacher checks, enhanced DBS
checks,

00:00:45.857 --> 00:00:49.236
safeguarding training and ongoing support.

00:00:50.113 --> 00:00:54.283
And behind every lesson, one connected
service.

00:00:54.323 --> 00:00:59.826
Purpose-built portals bring schools,
teachers and families together.

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:04.190
Your school portal puts the essentials in
view:

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:09.870
pupils, teaching days, your team and
available places.

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:13.300
See your agreed provision, access reports,

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:17.152
and contact My Music Lessons from one place.

00:01:18.013 --> 00:01:20.803
For teachers, clear timetables,

00:01:20.843 --> 00:01:24.053
lesson registers and practice notes

00:01:24.093 --> 00:01:26.133
keep the learning organised.

00:01:26.173 --> 00:01:28.573
That means a more connected experience,

00:01:28.613 --> 00:01:30.989
from the classroom to practice at home.

00:01:31.847 --> 00:01:35.897
Parents start on your school's lesson
website.

00:01:35.937 --> 00:01:38.947
Then their portal brings together lesson
details,

00:01:38.987 --> 00:01:43.047
payments, messages and practice guidance.

00:01:43.087 --> 00:01:45.157
Clear information for families,

00:01:45.197 --> 00:01:48.691
with our team managing the everyday
communication.

00:01:49.547 --> 00:01:50.847
Your part?

00:01:50.887 --> 00:01:53.227
Agree the space and arrangements,

00:01:53.267 --> 00:01:55.947
and introduce the service to families.

00:01:55.987 --> 00:01:58.307
Our team brings it together,

00:01:58.347 --> 00:02:01.583
with a named contact to support your school.

00:02:02.447 --> 00:02:04.167
The instruments.

00:02:04.207 --> 00:02:05.677
The teachers.

00:02:05.717 --> 00:02:07.137
The software.

00:02:07.177 --> 00:02:09.177
The everyday care.

00:02:09.217 --> 00:02:11.087
Bring music to your school.

00:02:11.127 --> 00:02:12.997
We'll take care of the rest.

00:02:13.037 --> 00:02:15.141
Talk to My Music Lessons today.
